    "key": "ui::panel::config::energy::battery::dialog::measurement_intro",
    "source": "Some batteries only measure the electricity that goes in and comes out. Others also measure where it comes from (grid or solar) and where it goes (home or grid). Check your battery's sensors and pick what they measure.",
